<title>UK: Mini-skirt queen Mary Quant joins House of Fraser.</title>
<headline>Mini-skirt queen Mary Quant joins House of Fraser.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mary Quant, the British designer who revolutionised fashion with the mini-skirt in the early 1960s, has joined retail group House of Fraser Plc as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>The company said Quant's experience of the fashion and retail business would benefit House of Fraser, which sells clothing and cosmetics across Britain.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
